# Retro Receipts — agent (public client) .gitignore
# This repo is PUBLIC. Nothing secret, no game data, no build output.

# ── Secrets — NEVER commit ──
.env
*.env
.env.*
# EXCEPTION: pwa/.env is the PWA's non-secret build-time default — only PUBLIC_API_BASE (a client-exposed
# same-origin default). It MUST be tracked so a fresh clone builds without setup. Real secrets / per-env
# overrides belong in .env.local (still ignored). Do not put anything secret in pwa/.env.
!pwa/.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.sec
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
credentials.json
*.token
*_token
.metasync_host_token
minisign*.sec
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ── Rust / Tauri (agent) build ──
target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk

# ── Injector (C) build output — ship SOURCE, not binaries ──
*.o
*.obj
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe

# ── Node / SvelteKit (pwa) ──
**/node_modules/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/build/
**/.vercel/
**/.output/

# ── Local data / logs / backups ──
*.log
*.bak
*.bak.*
records.json
matches.json
tokens.json
loadouts.json
latest.json
agent-latest*.json

# ── ROM-derived game data (BYOR — the app ships NO game data) ──
**/*.arc
**/*.gdi
**/*.afs
**/track*.bin
**/test-atlas/
**/skins/**/*.png

# ── Internal-only docs (private) ──
# NOTE: community RE docs STAY PUBLIC (owner decision 2026-08-22): STEAM-CODE-MAP.md,
# STEAM-RE-NOTES.md, MVC-NETPLAY-HANDSHAKE-PROTOCOL.md are intentionally tracked for the community.
# Only the genuinely-internal docs below are excluded (mirrors the old mvc2-metasync rules).
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
**/*-EXPERT*.md
**/*-HANDOVER*.md
**/*-CONTEXT*.md
docs/MVC2-STEAM-EXPERT.md
docs/STEAM-FIGHTER-STRUCT-MAP.md
docs/TRAINING-DATA-WISHLIST.md
docs/COLLECTION-BOOT-RE-HANDOVER.md
docs/KOM-SURREALDB-UNIFICATION.md
docs/BETA-READINESS.md

# ── OS ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ROM-derived character assets (BYOR) — regenerated by pwa/scripts/build-char-anim.py + render-char-portraits.py; never commit
pwa/static/chars/
pwa/static/chars-anim/
pwa/static/chars-png/

# legacy/ frozen 0.2.6 — ROM-derived data (pixel/palette/frame tables), never commit
legacy/web/idle_frames.json
legacy/web/studio/anim/
legacy/**/skins/
rr-render/target/

# ── Replay packs (ROM-derived game pixels) — served in dev from a local folder/junction, NEVER committed ──
pwa/static/replay/packs/
pwa/smoke-out/
# the smoke test's generated server-pack fixture manifest (names + hashes of ROM-derived art)
pwa/static/replay/packfix/
